WEBVTT

00:00.620 --> 00:01.660
Now, go!

00:01.660 --> 00:02.390
Yeah!

00:04.900 --> 00:06.150
Stay calm!

00:14.440 --> 00:16.750
You may be fast,

00:17.120 --> 00:19.980
but that doesn't matter if you 
don't know where I'm coming from!

00:19.980 --> 00:22.080
You're wide open!

00:22.080 --> 00:23.160
You're mine!

00:25.730 --> 00:28.650
N-No way...

00:28.650 --> 00:30.090
It can't be...

00:32.110 --> 00:34.590
I didn't think you'd actually fall for that.

00:34.840 --> 00:36.590
Not good enough!

00:40.600 --> 00:42.770
Once I've got you, you're mine!

00:43.560 --> 00:44.100
Amane!

00:44.380 --> 00:45.500
Sheesh.

00:45.500 --> 00:48.020
It would have been easier to just disable it.

00:48.020 --> 00:49.270
You lousy demon!

00:55.150 --> 00:56.570
I knew it. Snakes.

00:56.570 --> 00:59.710
It's my avatar, and I'm taking it back!

01:17.310 --> 01:18.480
Is it over?

01:18.480 --> 01:19.250
Yeah.

01:21.420 --> 01:24.210
That was way more exhausting than usual.

01:25.020 --> 01:27.020
My whole body feels heavy.

01:27.020 --> 01:28.180
I'm sorry.

01:28.180 --> 01:29.970
I still had you bound.

01:29.970 --> 01:31.210
Are you serious?

01:31.210 --> 01:33.700
Is that why I didn't have my full strength?

01:33.700 --> 01:35.950
Thanks for all your effort.

01:35.950 --> 01:37.590
Where did that come from?

01:37.590 --> 01:38.540
Oh, yeah...

01:38.540 --> 01:41.640
You better not have put 
that thing back inside me.

01:41.640 --> 01:43.450
I erased the snakes.

01:43.450 --> 01:45.130
What about the avatar?

01:45.130 --> 01:48.710
I returned it to myself, obviously.

01:49.960 --> 01:50.660
Amane!

01:53.790 --> 01:54.630
Amane?

01:55.210 --> 01:55.930
Hey!

02:03.240 --> 02:04.510
It's falling apart!

02:05.140 --> 02:06.490
I need to get out!

03:58.020 --> 04:00.270
What the hell am I thinking?!

04:03.000 --> 04:05.370
That was a hell of a day.

04:05.980 --> 04:08.580
I never thought this thing 
would have led to all this...

04:08.580 --> 04:11.380
Wait, I never solved that problem!

04:12.780 --> 04:14.030
Sorry.

04:14.030 --> 04:16.180
I guess we can deal with it tomorrow.

04:16.180 --> 04:17.230
Later.

04:24.920 --> 04:26.030
Amane?

04:28.190 --> 04:31.410
Don't leave.

04:32.660 --> 04:34.210
Huh?!

04:32.660 --> 04:36.080
<b>Huh?!</b>

04:34.210 --> 04:36.080
<i>What the hell is she talking about?!</i>

04:36.210 --> 04:40.920
<b>No, no, no, no!</b>

04:36.460 --> 04:38.600
<i>If she's telling me 
not to go home at this hour...</i>

04:38.600 --> 04:40.320
<i>Is she telling me to stay over?</i>

04:44.570 --> 04:45.970
<i>She's trembling.</i>

04:46.890 --> 04:48.290
<i>I see...</i>

04:48.290 --> 04:50.590
<i>She did seem off.</i>

04:51.690 --> 04:54.770
<i>I'm not eager to help an angel, but...</i>

04:57.730 --> 04:59.430
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

05:12.410 --> 05:14.770
<i>That was a long day.</i>

05:17.020 --> 05:21.720
<i>Even without the avatar, 
I can't escape as long as I have this thing.</i>

05:23.040 --> 05:26.600
<i>I did ask her to at least change it 
to a less obvious color,</i>

05:26.600 --> 05:28.650
<i>but that never got anywhere, either.</i>

05:29.370 --> 05:32.870
<i>She said it was under 
someone's control, right?</i>

05:35.770 --> 05:38.070
<i>Was there some kind of issue in Heaven?</i>

05:39.480 --> 05:42.100
<i>Not that it's my problem either way, I guess.</i>

05:42.580 --> 05:45.610
<i>But I wish she'd return the favor 
for me helping her out.</i>

05:50.570 --> 05:53.060
<i>Wait, why did I end up helping her?</i>

05:53.910 --> 05:56.250
<i>I could have just left her to it.</i>

05:56.250 --> 05:58.210
Goodbye!

05:56.250 --> 06:01.630
<b>Goodbye!</b>

05:58.210 --> 06:01.100
<i>Not that I'd want to watch her 
die right in front of me.</i>

06:02.120 --> 06:03.620
<i>Wait a second, am I...</i>

06:04.200 --> 06:06.220
<i>A really good guy?</i>

06:06.760 --> 06:09.090
I don't know about that.

06:09.940 --> 06:10.720
Who are you?!

06:15.530 --> 06:17.620
I'm me.

06:18.120 --> 06:20.020
Yeah, so who are you?

06:21.030 --> 06:22.190
I'm...

06:22.820 --> 06:23.950
You!

06:24.420 --> 06:26.200
He's pretty bold for a guy 
who just messed up.

06:26.930 --> 06:28.680
Huh? What's going on?

06:28.680 --> 06:29.540
Am I dreaming?

06:29.940 --> 06:31.450
Is this a doppelganger situation?

06:31.750 --> 06:33.680
It doesn't matter.

06:33.680 --> 06:35.240
It absolutely does!

06:37.140 --> 06:39.570
It's true that you're a good guy.

06:40.010 --> 06:41.790
But that isn't all, is it?

06:42.210 --> 06:43.820
What do you want?

06:45.310 --> 06:47.300
You're a demon.

06:47.300 --> 06:49.050
She's an angel.

06:49.340 --> 06:53.070
There must be a reason you saved an enemy.

06:53.070 --> 06:54.230
A reason?

06:54.780 --> 06:55.850
That's right.

06:56.690 --> 06:58.680
You're in love!

06:59.980 --> 07:02.810
Wh-What?!

07:03.730 --> 07:05.690
What are you talking about?

07:05.690 --> 07:07.380
That's obviously not true!

07:08.580 --> 07:11.760
It's fine. You don't need to hide it.

07:11.760 --> 07:12.660
I mean...

07:13.300 --> 07:17.270
I know everything about you.

07:18.940 --> 07:21.650
Don't be so negative.

07:21.650 --> 07:23.210
I'm not.

07:23.520 --> 07:26.170
I think you've got a good chance.

07:27.250 --> 07:31.160
She just asked you not to leave.

07:31.650 --> 07:34.230
Because she's scared, obviously.

07:34.890 --> 07:37.600
You don't understand women, do you?

07:38.130 --> 07:41.980
What kind of person does she 
want around at a time like this?

07:43.370 --> 07:45.890
Well, I guess...

07:46.910 --> 07:47.730
That's right.

07:47.730 --> 07:49.740
She's got...

07:49.740 --> 07:51.740
She's got...

07:51.740 --> 07:53.600
Feelings for you!

07:53.600 --> 07:55.340
Feelings for me?!

07:56.980 --> 07:58.370
I see!

07:58.370 --> 08:00.660
I understand perfectly now!

08:01.090 --> 08:04.710
In other words, sleeping in that bed 
right now is a girl who likes me?

08:04.710 --> 08:06.080
Exactly!

08:06.080 --> 08:08.790
You understand perfectly, don't you?!

08:13.080 --> 08:15.290
The princess is awake.

08:15.290 --> 08:18.430
Now, show me your adorable face!

08:19.070 --> 08:20.670
Giddy, giddy!

08:20.670 --> 08:22.060
Thump, thump!

08:25.690 --> 08:28.520
I don't know about that!

08:51.590 --> 08:53.220
I'm home?

08:55.830 --> 08:58.090
I guess I never changed out of my uniform.

09:20.680 --> 09:23.310
I can't remember how I got home.

09:24.940 --> 09:25.780
Akutsu!

09:25.780 --> 09:27.010
What's wrong with you?!

09:27.010 --> 09:28.320
Why are you here?!

09:28.320 --> 09:29.650
Sensei...

09:29.650 --> 09:31.710
Please, no...

09:31.710 --> 09:33.150
He's talking in his sleep.

09:33.460 --> 09:35.540
Why is he in my bedroom?

09:36.470 --> 09:38.290
Don't leave.

09:38.820 --> 09:40.710
Don't leave.

09:41.250 --> 09:42.950
<i>Don't leave.</i>

09:43.390 --> 09:45.230
<i>Don't leave.</i>

09:45.810 --> 09:46.980
<b>Ngahhhh</b>

09:47.140 --> 09:48.600
<b>Urhghhhh</b>

09:48.990 --> 09:53.290
<i>What have you done, you sleep-talking fool?!</i>

09:53.290 --> 09:55.110
<i>I'm left with no choice.</i>

09:55.530 --> 10:01.570
<i>I shall erase your memories 
with this Baalbek ruin-looking thing!</i>

10:13.180 --> 10:14.380
<i>Yeah...</i>

10:14.380 --> 10:15.830
<i>That's from when...</i>

10:16.760 --> 10:18.780
<i>He got hurt protecting me.</i>

10:29.570 --> 10:33.480
Why did you save me?

10:34.070 --> 10:35.760
We're enemies.

10:35.760 --> 10:38.520
You could have chosen to abandon me.

10:38.520 --> 10:40.760
Or do you, well...

10:41.260 --> 10:42.370
Have...

10:43.300 --> 10:46.120
In any case, er...

10:46.700 --> 10:48.840
Th-Thanks.

10:51.550 --> 10:52.710
I said it!

10:52.710 --> 10:55.530
Don't you dare ask for any more gratitude!

10:55.530 --> 10:56.840
Or for rewards!

10:57.220 --> 11:02.090
<i>Shoot! I did say I'd give him 
a hug as a reward!</i>

11:02.650 --> 11:07.560
For every ten jobs well done, 
I shall give you a hug.

11:07.560 --> 11:11.940
<i>I was just kidding, but if he remembers that...</i>

11:12.390 --> 11:16.210
<i>What he did was worth about 
ten thousand jobs well done.</i>

11:16.210 --> 11:19.170
Sensei, you're so heavy...

11:19.170 --> 11:23.880
<i>It's cowardly, but I suppose I should 
make it an established fact.</i>

11:24.590 --> 11:28.830
B-By the way, you did a good job.

11:28.830 --> 11:29.980
I shall reward...

11:29.260 --> 11:32.030
H-Hug...

11:36.420 --> 11:38.130
Wh-Wh-What are you...

11:38.130 --> 11:39.420
Are you out of your mind?!

11:39.420 --> 11:41.340
There's no way we could!

11:41.340 --> 11:43.680
Don't be so absurd!

11:45.150 --> 11:47.430
<i>I was the one who said it first!</i>

11:48.260 --> 11:49.210
<i>What do I do?</i>

11:49.210 --> 11:52.860
<i>My pride won't let me back down on what I said.</i>

11:52.860 --> 11:53.650
<i>Still!</i>

11:55.130 --> 11:56.830
<i>What the hell? A hug?!</i>

11:56.830 --> 11:59.110
<i>That's so embarrassing!</i>

11:59.110 --> 12:03.110
Stop it, Sensei... Please, don't...

11:59.380 --> 12:03.110
<i>Should I pretend that never happened?</i>

12:09.950 --> 12:12.740
J-Just this once.

12:12.740 --> 12:14.290
I'm not doing it again.

12:17.070 --> 12:19.500
J-Just this once.

12:19.500 --> 12:21.460
I'm not doing it again.

12:31.610 --> 12:32.770
<i>Hang on.</i>

12:32.770 --> 12:35.150
<i>Akutsu's asleep.</i>

12:35.150 --> 12:37.060
<i>I can't hug him now.</i>

12:37.480 --> 12:40.020
<i>I can't wake him up either, though.</i>

12:40.020 --> 12:41.360
<i>Wh-What...</i>

12:41.360 --> 12:43.740
How
am
I
supposed
to
be
hugged?

12:44.530 --> 12:49.150
<i>Still, I don't want him getting on 
my case after he wakes up, either.</i>

12:49.150 --> 12:52.130
<i>I'm damned if I do, damned if I don't!</i>

12:53.560 --> 12:55.000
All right, next.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.710
Techniques for Seducing Women (Basics)

12:55.000 --> 12:58.890
In order to understand women, 
you think like a woman.

12:58.890 --> 13:00.840
Naturally, then, you will understand.

13:00.840 --> 13:03.510
Okay, I'll demonstrate.

13:04.780 --> 13:08.030
H-Hurry!

13:09.550 --> 13:10.960
What's that about?

13:10.960 --> 13:12.830
Don't think! Feel!

13:12.830 --> 13:13.770
Try it!

13:15.870 --> 13:17.650
Hurry!

13:17.650 --> 13:18.680
That's it!

13:18.680 --> 13:20.330
Do it again!

13:20.330 --> 13:21.760
Hurry!

13:21.760 --> 13:24.670
Good! With more feminine charm!

13:25.290 --> 13:26.990
H-H...

13:29.030 --> 13:30.700
Hurry!

13:31.280 --> 13:33.000
He's awake!

13:33.000 --> 13:34.570
<i>Wait, is he still asleep?</i>

13:35.430 --> 13:37.830
<i>To think he would egg me on, 
even in his sleep...</i>

13:37.830 --> 13:39.680
<i>Hurry!</i>

13:38.950 --> 13:40.090
Sh-Shush!

13:40.090 --> 13:42.590
I was just about to do it!

13:43.820 --> 13:45.130
But...

13:45.450 --> 13:47.380
Where do I start?

13:50.640 --> 13:51.720
Found it!

13:51.720 --> 13:52.930
That's the spot!

13:52.930 --> 13:55.730
It'll be a bit more hug-like if I fit there.

14:26.820 --> 14:30.050
<i>Don't you dare wake up, Akutsu!</i>

14:35.480 --> 14:38.020
<i>Th-That should be enough...</i>

14:43.230 --> 14:47.490
<i>E-E-E-Emergency!</i>

14:48.820 --> 14:50.410
Like a feather.

14:50.410 --> 14:51.910
Good smell.

14:57.780 --> 14:59.780
<i>Is he trembling?</i>

15:01.210 --> 15:04.880
<i>He did nearly lose his life.</i>

15:04.880 --> 15:06.300
<i>I can't blame him.</i>

15:06.800 --> 15:09.420
<i>Of course he'd have nightmares.</i>

15:13.690 --> 15:21.090
<i>I never thought, though, that just being 
with someone could be so relaxing.</i>

15:23.150 --> 15:25.270
<i>I totally forgot.</i>

15:25.650 --> 15:27.900
<i>I need to change the color of this thing.</i>

15:29.560 --> 15:31.000
<i>Jeez.</i>

15:36.070 --> 15:40.910
<i>It ended up being a really special reward.</i>

15:53.450 --> 15:55.170
That ought to do it.

15:59.930 --> 16:01.780
<i>Sorry, I have no money</i>

15:59.930 --> 16:05.440
<b>Sorry, I have no money</b>

16:01.780 --> 16:03.180
<i>What are you, a thief?!</i>

16:03.180 --> 16:05.440
<i>I'm going to bill you later!</i>

16:05.440 --> 16:09.690
<i>How did he bring me home, anyway?</i>

16:12.320 --> 16:13.070
<b>Nah, no way.</b>

16:12.380 --> 16:14.300
<i>Nah, no way.</i>

16:13.070 --> 16:14.320
<b>Nah, no way.</b>

16:16.360 --> 16:18.370
<i>Nope, nope, nope.</i>

16:16.700 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:16.870 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:17.030 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:17.200 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:17.370 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:17.530 --> 16:17.700
<b>Nope</b>

16:19.060 --> 16:20.530
<i>Which can only mean...</i>

16:24.580 --> 16:26.130
<b>Ahhh!</b>

16:29.350 --> 16:31.800
<i>He was totally carrying me!</i>

16:45.420 --> 16:46.600
What's going on?!

16:46.600 --> 16:48.590
It must be Amane's doing!

16:55.210 --> 16:56.350
Guess I'll leave.

17:16.490 --> 17:18.080
Oh, right.

17:18.080 --> 17:19.420
The lock here...

17:41.850 --> 17:42.830
Hey.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.270
Did I wake you?

17:44.270 --> 17:47.330
No, it was about time for
me to wake up anyway.

17:47.330 --> 17:48.140
Yeah?

17:48.620 --> 17:50.380
So, how are you feeling?

17:50.800 --> 17:53.640
I don't need a demon's concern.

17:53.640 --> 17:56.270
You sound like you're doing fine.

17:56.270 --> 17:58.390
Why are you still here?

18:02.990 --> 18:04.090
What's this?

18:04.520 --> 18:06.550
I was hungry.

18:06.550 --> 18:09.050
So I helped myself to your fridge.

18:10.270 --> 18:13.540
No, I mean, why did you make some for me?

18:13.540 --> 18:14.330
To thank you.

18:14.330 --> 18:15.140
For?

18:15.700 --> 18:16.810
For this.

18:20.230 --> 18:21.870
I'm just doing my duty as your owner.

18:21.870 --> 18:22.700
Sure, sure.

18:23.100 --> 18:25.330
Also, I can't lock the door here.

18:25.330 --> 18:26.280
So I figured...

18:26.280 --> 18:28.880
It'll lock if you close it.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.560
Oh, I see.

18:30.560 --> 18:31.540
It's an auto lock.

18:38.050 --> 18:40.350
Never mind that. Let's eat.

18:40.810 --> 18:43.900
It's not going to be as good 
as your pasta, though.

18:44.740 --> 18:47.300
Y-You don't know that.

18:48.420 --> 18:50.130
N-Never mind.

18:55.590 --> 18:57.490
Thank you.

18:57.820 --> 18:58.910
Whoops.

19:00.820 --> 19:02.500
Time to eat.

19:11.160 --> 19:13.710
Just this one time.

19:17.990 --> 19:19.090
What's up?

19:20.010 --> 19:22.360
I was just showing off a little.

19:25.210 --> 19:27.310
You have so many green peppers at your place.

19:27.310 --> 19:29.450
They happened to be on sale.

19:30.250 --> 19:32.880
Why buy them if you hate them, 
even if they were on sale?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.750
I never said I hate them.

19:34.750 --> 19:35.890
Did you not?

19:35.890 --> 19:37.450
Just shut up and eat.

19:37.450 --> 19:37.980
Mm-hm.

19:58.430 --> 20:01.090
<i>He's weirdly radiant.</i>

20:04.740 --> 20:05.750
Later.

20:06.410 --> 20:07.470
Hey!

20:07.470 --> 20:09.470
School's this way.

20:09.810 --> 20:12.020
I'm skipping first period.

20:12.020 --> 20:14.350
I'm going home to shower.

20:14.350 --> 20:17.410
Do you really think that's acceptable?

20:17.410 --> 20:19.520
You don't have to say it like that.

20:19.520 --> 20:21.740
I helped you yesterday, you know.

20:23.000 --> 20:26.440
Well, well, good thing you saved me yesterday.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.660
What's that supposed to mean?

20:27.660 --> 20:33.160
If that thing had taken me out, 
your collar would have exploded.

20:33.160 --> 20:34.930
Y-You're kidding!

20:40.570 --> 20:42.500
How is that a thing?!

20:43.350 --> 20:44.430
I lied.

20:44.430 --> 20:46.640
Cut it out with the silly lies!

20:46.640 --> 20:47.930
Did I scare you?

20:48.310 --> 20:49.390
Huh?

20:50.120 --> 20:51.200
Not really.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.830
I changed the color.

20:52.830 --> 20:53.910
Be grateful.

20:54.690 --> 20:57.190
I did it while you were asleep.

20:57.740 --> 20:59.730
I promised, after all.

20:59.730 --> 21:00.860
Really?

21:00.860 --> 21:02.620
Yay!

21:02.990 --> 21:05.250
Thanks, Amane!

21:05.250 --> 21:06.940
Here we go, to the super sento baths!

21:06.940 --> 21:08.530
Here we go, to the pools!

21:08.530 --> 21:10.520
Stop it, you're embarrassing me!

21:12.700 --> 21:15.210
Well, well!

21:17.380 --> 21:23.720
A-A-Akkun and Lily-chan 
are doing morning-after stuff!

21:23.720 --> 21:25.150
Morning after! Morning after!

21:25.150 --> 21:27.010
Morning after! Morning after!

22:56.970 --> 22:59.230
Akutsu's Truth

22:59.720 --> 23:02.890
Hold me tighter!

23:02.890 --> 23:06.370
Please, no more!

23:07.820 --> 23:11.880
<i>He did nearly lose his life.</i>

23:11.880 --> 23:13.320
<i>I can't blame him.</i>

23:15.710 --> 23:19.630
<i>Of course he'd have nightmares.</i>

23:24.670 --> 23:27.200
So that's what really happened.

23:27.200 --> 23:29.490
Saved by a misunderstanding.

23:29.490 --> 23:33.350
So there was an opportunity 
hidden in the worst of situations.

23:34.030 --> 23:37.410
It's funny how the world works, huh?
